<HelpLayout title="Help" description="Help for the Badger workout tracker: logging sets, running programs, progression, history, progress, gyms, backup and importing.">
  <h1>Help</h1>

  <p>Pick what you came to do, or search from the box at the top of the menu.</p>

  <h2>New to Badger</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={`/help/getting-started/`}>Quick start</a>: install, set your units and log your first workout.</li>
    <li><a href={`/guides/`}>Pick a guide</a> that matches how you train.</li>
    <li><a href={`/guides/overview/`}>Everything Badger does</a>, one line per feature.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Log a workout</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={`/help/logging/`}>Log sets</a>: warmups, RPE and RIR, supersets and finishing a workout.</li>
    <li><a href={`/help/logging/#rest-timer`}>Time your rest</a> or a <a href={`/help/logging/#set-timer`}>timed set</a>.</li>
    <li><a href={`/help/exercises/`}>Find or create an exercise</a>.</li>
    <li><a href={`/help/gyms/#workout-context`}>Pick the machine, bar or grip</a> for a set.</li>
    <li><a href={`/help/tools/`}>Work out the plates</a> for a weight, or a <a href={`/help/tools/#warmup-calc`}>warm-up</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Build or run a program</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={`/help/routines/`}>Build a routine</a> and start workouts from it.</li>
    <li><a href={`/help/routines/#programs`}>Start from a built-in program</a>, or download one from <a href={`/programs/`}>Programs</a>.</li>
    <li><a href={`/help/progression/`}>Understand how your weights go up</a>: rules, training maxes, percentage sets and waved days.</li>
    <li><a href={`/help/tools/#deload`}>Take a deload</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>See how you're doing</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={`/help/history/`}>Find a past workout</a> in the list or the calendar.</li>
    <li><a href={`/help/progress/`}>Check whether a lift is going up</a>: records, graphs, strength standards and plateaus.</li>
    <li><a href={`/help/body/`}>Track body weight and measurements</a>, with Apple Health or Health Connect.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Set up your gym</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={`/help/gyms/`}>Add your gyms and equipment</a>: machines, bars, bands and chains, and dumbbell racks.</li>
  </ul>

